WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.777
Minw b'a fɛ ka banabagatɔw kɛnɛya, ani ka den sɔrɔ, walama ka siman sɔrɔ, olugu le bɛ jigi ka na ni o ta sarakaw ye.

00:00:08.857 --> 00:00:12.366
U b'a fɔ ko n'u y'u kunbɛn, u be mɛnni kɛ u fɛ.

00:00:12.446 --> 00:00:15.726
N'u y'o kɛ, u ka ɲi ka kɔsegi ni kɔnɔgwɛ ye.
